import type { ServiceNotes } from './types';

// Specialty mid-term lines: travel nurse, corporate, film & production, student.
//
// These four services are ANCHOR-DRIVEN. The local story is only real where the
// anchor is real — a hospital campus, a corporate headquarters, a sound stage, a
// teaching institution. Where the anchor is absent, the key is absent too, and
// that is the correct outcome rather than a gap to be filled. Roughly half the
// city × service combinations offered by these four service lines deliberately
// have no entry here.
//
// Every proper noun, address and figure below was checked against a primary
// source (the hospital system, the studio, the city, the university, the county)
// during authoring in August 2026. Nothing is written from memory. Where a fact
// could not be confirmed at a primary source it was left out, and where leaving
// it out gutted the entry, the entry was dropped.
//
// Two facts we will never state, because they are commonly repeated and wrong:
// Wellstar Atlanta Medical Center closed on 1 November 2022, and the Wellstar
// East Point campus (the former Atlanta Medical Center South) lost its emergency
// department and inpatient beds in May 2022 with the remaining urgent care
// closing in January 2024. Neither is an open hospital.

