    'What the property has to have is unglamorous: a driveway or an assigned space, in-unit laundry, blackout in the bedroom, and internet we have actually speed-tested rather than assumed. Peachtree Industrial and I-85 do the rest. We name the specific campus a property serves instead of writing "convenient to Gwinnett hospitals," because that phrase does not survive first contact with a nurse checking a map.',
