    'The other Duluth-specific point is what surrounds the property. The city’s Korean business district means a clinician on a rota has real grocery, food and pharmacy options close to home, which matters far more across thirteen weeks than it does across a weekend. We put that in the listing rather than leaving a guest to discover it, because a traveler comparing two similar homes decides on precisely that kind of detail.',
