    'Contract staff move around inside a system like that. Float pools cross campuses, an extension can arrive attached to a different building, and a clinician who liked their house will take the reassignment rather than the relocation. So we market a Lawrenceville property against the whole system and the neighboring one, not against a single address — and we write the occupancy agreement so a term can extend without a fresh negotiation each time.',
